[AV]helper (optional)


-----
AVpos
-----

"MILKER STALL" AVsitter 2.2
MTYPE 3

RLV 1
ROLES S|D
ONSIT CAPTURE
ONTOUCH ASK
TIMELOCK 5
RECAPTURE 1
ONCAPTURE @unsit=n|@fartouch=n
ONRELEASE @unsit=n
SUBCONTROL 1

SITTER 0

POSE Cow Milking|sit_cow_idle
SYNC Breeding|breed_cow_anim
{Cow Milking}<-0.047,-0.234,-0.162><180,0,-90>
{Breeding}<-0.249,-0.115,-1.025><-180,-5,0>

SITTER 1

POSE Breeding|breed_bull_anim
SYNC Breeding|breed_bull_anim
{Breeding}<-0.254,-0.095,-1.025><-180,-5,0>
